        "why": "The solid weighs the same in 20MnCr5 and 42CrMo4, so the CAD cannot tell a carburised gear from a through-hardened one — and the choice changes the heat-treat route, the finishing route and the feeds the teeth are cut at. The model read \"case_hardening_steel\" off the drawing/context — confirm or correct it before it reaches the costing.",
